DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
9967::$$$message_0075_0000_0000$$$::"Good morning, Emiya."[lr]::
9968::$$$message_0075_0000_0001$$$::"Oh, morning, Issei."[lr]::
9969::$$$message_0075_0000_0002$$$::I greet Issei who came out of the student council room.[lr]::
9970::$$$message_0075_0000_0003$$$::As expected of the student council president; he's so enthusiastic about his work in the morning.::
9971::$$$message_0075_0001_0000$$$::"Oh yeah, you're still the student council president, huh."[lr]::
9972::$$$message_0075_0001_0001$$$::"What is the hesitation for, Emiya?"[lr]::
9973::$$$message_0075_0001_0002$$$::Issei Ryudou is known as the student council president, and this fact won't change.[lr]::
9974::$$$message_0075_0001_0003$$$::The atmosphere that envelops Homurahara is that "Issei = student council president."[lr]::
9975::$$$message_0075_0001_0004$$$::People had said that he was a student council president candidate even when he was a first-year, and he's been meeting those expectations more than enough.[lr]::
9976::$$$message_0075_0001_0005$$$::I'm sure he'd still be called president even once he retires, and there's no doubt that he'd be called that even as an alumnus.[lr]::
9977::$$$message_0075_0001_0006$$$::No, more than that...::
9978::$$$message_0075_0002_0000$$$::"Every club passes the baton to the next generation, though."[lr]::
9979::$$$message_0075_0002_0001$$$::"That much is obvious. I've been preparing, but there's no one to pass onto even if I wanted to."::
9980::$$$message_0075_0003_0000$$$::That is true.[lr]::
9981::$$$message_0075_0003_0001$$$::It may be that Issei's student council president aura is too strong, there were no candidates or recommendations in the student council elections after. So an unprecedented situation was happening where the president election was postponed to the next semester.::
9982::$$$message_0075_0004_0000$$$::"Man, you've got a lot of weight on your shoulders, Issei."[lr]::
9983::$$$message_0075_0004_0001$$$::"Yes. If there was appropriate talent that was chosen at the election, then I expect to be called the former student council president.[lr]::
9984::$$$message_0075_0004_0002$$$::It appears as though this year's second years lack conviction and endurance."[lr]::
9985::$$$message_0075_0004_0003$$$::He mutters, trying to compose himself.[lr]::
9986::$$$message_0075_0004_0004$$$::It must be a great source of concern to Issei, since there's not enough energy in his voice.::
9987::$$$message_0075_0005_0000$$$::"Is it hard to pass on the student council?"[lr]::
9988::$$$message_0075_0005_0001$$$::"No, not exactly.[lr]::
9989::$$$message_0075_0005_0002$$$::The current executive office is actually working towards having the re-election of the president in March, with the second-year secretaries taking the lead."::
9990::$$$message_0075_0006_0000$$$::"There's no notable second years that you're going to try encouraging?[lr]::
9991::$$$message_0075_0006_0001$$$::The last vice president was like your student, right?"[lr]::
9992::$$$message_0075_0006_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=一成03a(中) textoff=0]If not, there's a big possibility that it might end in failure again.[lr]::
9993::$$$message_0075_0006_0003$$$::Well... It's not good to have Issei stay for half a year longer just to remain in office.::
9994::$$$message_0075_0007_0000$$$::"That won't do. It's different if she runs as a candidate on her own volition, but I can't recommend her."[lr]::
9995::$$$message_0075_0007_0001$$$::"Huh? Why not?"[lr]::
9996::$$$message_0075_0007_0002$$$::"It won't help her, and I can cause factions to form if things don't go well. It won't go as far as a puppet state, but the captains of the athletic clubs won't be happy with my recommendation."::
9997::$$$message_0075_0008_0000$$$::"First of all, the student council is something determined by legitimate and democratic elections. I am not the one to decide who will be my successor; it must be all the students." [lr]::
9998::$$$message_0075_0008_0001$$$::"...I see."[lr]::
9999::$$$message_0075_0008_0002$$$::How admirable of the student council president.[lr]::
10000::$$$message_0075_0008_0003$$$::As long as there is this implacable man, the next president election must be a difficult voyage too.::
10001::$$$message_0075_0009_0000$$$::"However... It's true that there's no one else qualified other than Kirishima.[lr]::
10002::$$$message_0075_0009_0001$$$::She jokes asking if I would just stay another year, but there won't be much progress like that.[lr]::
10003::$$$message_0075_0009_0002$$$::That doesn't mean there's any second-years that can assume my mantle."[lr]::
10004::$$$message_0075_0009_0003$$$::"That's pretty tough."::
10005::$$$message_0075_0010_0000$$$::"Emiya, if you were a grade below me, I probably would've abdicated."[lr]::
10006::$$$message_0075_0010_0001$$$::[font italic=true]Abdicate, as in give up the seat of student council president to me?[font italic=false][lr]::
10007::$$$message_0075_0010_0002$$$::Scary.::
10008::$$$message_0075_0011_0000$$$::"However, there's still time.[lr]::
10009::$$$message_0075_0011_0001$$$::It's not too bad to continue being student council president until graduation. Well, I'm also fortunate to receive the opportunity to extend my position."::
10010::$$$message_0075_0012_0000$$$::The road map that Issei established for reorganization when he got elected with an overwhelming amount of votes as a second year.[lr]::
10011::$$$message_0075_0012_0001$$$::But Issei didn't get elected because of the road map, but because Issei's existence itself makes him a student council president. There were not many students paying attention to the rest.::
10012::$$$message_0075_0013_0000$$$::"Does that mean you have things left that you want to do?"[lr]::
10013::$$$message_0075_0013_0001$$$::"Yes. The cause that prevents the reorganization of Homurahara has not been removed yet."[lr]::
10014::$$$message_0075_0013_0002$$$::"I see... Well, it's been the unspoken rule for about ten years. One semester wasn't enough, huh?"::
10015::$$$message_0075_0014_0000$$$::"If I had at least one more year of office, then I could have put an end to the unequal club budget problem, optimize club structure, and motion the regulation revision of the school... [cacheimage storage=一成01c(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=一成01c(中) textoff=0]How disappointing."::
10016::$$$message_0075_0015_0000$$$::He must have many regrets.[lr]::
10017::$$$message_0075_0015_0001$$$::Watching from the sidelines, I think Issei was doing well, but if I were to say just one thing...his allocation of passion was weird.[lr]::
10018::$$$message_0075_0015_0002$$$::One of the causes was Issei's...::
10019::$$$message_0075_0016_0000$$$::"All of it is that Tohsaka's fault."[lr]::
10020::$$$message_0075_0016_0001$$$::"...Uh huh."[lr]::
10021::$$$message_0075_0016_0002$$$::"Tohsaka took the athletic club's side, interfered with the school trip, and on top of that, she threatens and deceives board members with her latent power. She twisted their opinions, and as a result, reorganization got delayed."[lr]::
10022::$$$message_0075_0016_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=一成02a(中) textoff=0]The usual Issei, bearing deep resentment.[lr]::
10023::$$$message_0075_0016_0004$$$::At this point, I have to settle in and listen to everything, or the subject of this tirade will make an appearance and everything devolves into war.::
10024::$$$message_0075_0017_0000$$$::"Ugh, if my wasted effort wasn't taken by that terror named Tohsaka, then I would have lived a peaceful and secluded life."[lr]::
10025::$$$message_0075_0017_0001$$$::"...Well, I think Tohsaka took your policy quite well. She didn't oppose them with just her feelings like the other captains did, right?"::
10026::$$$message_0075_0018_0000$$$::"...I know. That is why I cannot lose against her in an argument...[lr]::
10027::$$$message_0075_0018_0001$$$::So, are you taking Tohsaka's side?"[lr]::
10028::$$$message_0075_0018_0002$$$::"Well, I don't know if you'd call that taking sides..."[lr]::
10029::$$$message_0075_0018_0003$$$::I know how scary she is, so I'm worried for Issei.[lr]::
10030::$$$message_0075_0018_0004$$$::I can only pray that they won't take each other out, mutual kill-style.::
10031::$$$message_0075_0019_0000$$$::"Mrgh, Tohsaka, you... Now things have come to this, coming for my right-hand by luring him with your charm... [cacheimage storage=一成01b腕(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=一成01b腕(中) time=400]Even as my enemy, I admit that is the most effective attack, indeed."::
10032::$$$message_0075_0020_0000$$$::Issei nods.[lr]::
10033::$$$message_0075_0020_0001$$$::I feel like there's a part of him that admires Tohsaka.[lr]::
10034::$$$message_0075_0020_0002$$$::"Oh... Could it be that you..."[lr]::
10035::$$$message_0075_0020_0003$$$::"What is it, Emiya?"[lr]::
10036::$$$message_0075_0020_0004$$$::"Are you lonely without Tohsaka?"[lr]::
10037::$$$message_0075_0020_0005$$$::Woah. Issei is backing up with incredible force.::
10038::$$$message_0075_0021_0000$$$::"W-wha[line len=2]! What do you mean by that, Emiya!?[lr]::
10039::$$$message_0075_0021_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=一成03d頬(遠) textoff=0]G-give me an answer!"::
10040::$$$message_0075_0022_0000$$$::"Fine. See, you always mention Tohsaka at every opportunity you get. I figured it wouldn't be as rewarding if you didn't have a rival like her."[lr]::
10041::$$$message_0075_0022_0001$$$::"How rude. Do I look like I would wish for a rival that in any way resembles that creature?"::
10042::$$$message_0075_0023_0000$$$::"I bet Tohsaka feels the same.[lr]::
10043::$$$message_0075_0023_0001$$$::In that sense, you guys are fated for each other."[lr]::
10044::$$$message_0075_0023_0002$$$::I laugh, thinking about how their dynamic is actually kinda impressive.[lr]::
10045::$$$message_0075_0023_0003$$$::[se storage=se020.wav]Oh, it's almost time for homeroom.::
10046::$$$message_0075_0024_0000$$$::"Mrgh, I guess we're out of time. I'm going to clarify what you think regarding this matter later, Emiya."[lr]::
10047::$$$message_0075_0024_0001$$$::"All right. I'll listen to your complaints about Tohsaka as much as you want."::
10048::$$$message_0075_0025_0000$$$::"...The way you say that bothers me. Why are you looking at me with such a disagreeable expression?"[lr]::
10049::$$$message_0075_0025_0001$$$::[font italic=true]Well, I mean...[font italic=false][lr]::
10050::$$$message_0075_0025_0002$$$::It seems like the more we discuss, the more it proves that Issei and Tohsaka are inseparable.::
10051::$$$message_0075_0026_0000$$$::"Oh, we should hurry back to the classroom. Fuji-nee will beat us if we're loafing around here."[lr]::
10052::$$$message_0075_0026_0001$$$::"Ms. Fujimura, huh? She certainly doesn't take it easy on school rules. Let's go, Emiya."::
909987::$$$message_9075_0005_0000$$$::"Is it hard to pass on the student council?"[r]::